  expr_casts_err_type_value.pcpp - break step of expr_casts.pcpp:
  a type used as a value (SM0269)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\expr_casts_err_type_value.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\expr_casts_err_type_value.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
